'''Pumpkin Patch''' is a [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] gun that was obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]] by purchasing the [[2025 Halloween Box]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The body of this gun is covered in leaves, in various hues of green. There are pumpkins placed in various locations of the gun. It can be seen that an orange pumpkin is located on the center of the gun, with another pumpkin at the tip of the barrel, along with a pumpkin near the handle above the frame as well. 

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Pumpkin (2025)|partner knife]] under the same name.

